{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2021-02-17 09:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN EXPRESS TO OPEN NEW CENTURION® LOUNGE AT RONALD REAGAN WASHINGTON NATIONAL AIRPORT AND EXPAND CENTURION LOUNGES IN SEATTLE AND SAN FRANCISCO', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN EXPRESS (NYSE: AXP) TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO OPEN ITS 16TH CENTURION LOUNGE AT WASHINGTON, D.C.'S, REAGAN NATIONAL AIRPORT (DCA), AND EXPAND ITS SEATTLE-TACOMA INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT (SEA) AND SAN FRANCISCO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT (SFO) LOCATIONS. ALL THREE LOCATIONS ARE EXPECTED TO OPEN BY THE END OF 2022 WITH ADDITIONAL UPDATES TO BE COMMUNICATED CLOSER TO THAT TIME. A RECENT AMEX TRENDEX* SURVEY FOUND THAT A MAJORITY OF CONSUMERS (62%) WOULD FEEL COMFORTABLE"}